  "That backup is empty.": "Daardie rugsteun is leeg.",
  "That backup is in format {version}, which this build doesn't know how to read.": "Daardie rugsteun is in formaat {version}, wat hierdie bou nie weet hoe om te lees nie.",
  "That doesn't look like a URL. Paste an addon link, or one starting with https://": "Dit lyk nie na 'n URL nie. Plak 'n byvoegingskakel, of een wat met https:// begin.",
  "That file isn't JSON, so it isn't a backup.": "Daardie lêer is nie JSON nie, so dit is nie 'n rugsteun nie.",
  "That isn't a Rivulet backup.": "Dit is nie 'n Rivulet-rugsteun nie.",
  "That picture couldn't be saved. Try a smaller one, or a JPEG or PNG.": "Daardie prent kon nie gestoor word nie. Probeer 'n kleiner een, of 'n JPEG of PNG.",
  "That source is already in the list.": "Daardie bron is reeds in die lys.",
