  "The connection to the torrent engine dropped mid-stream.": "Die verbinding met die torrentenjin het middel-in die stroom geval.",
  "The link this source gave answered HTTP {status}. It may have expired — search the sources again for a fresh one.": "Die skakel wat hierdie bron gegee het, het HTTP {status} geantwoord. Dit het dalk verval — deursoek die bronne weer vir 'n vars een.",
  "The link this source gave could not be reached.": "Die skakel wat hierdie bron gegee het, kon nie bereik word nie.",
  "The picture currently behind the app": "Die prent tans agter die program",
  "The player area never got a size, so playback was not started.": "Die spelergebied het nooit 'n grootte gekry nie, so terugspeel is nie begin nie.",
  "The player itself — decoding, subtitles and audio. GPLv2 or later.": "Die speler self — dekodering, onderskrifte en klank. GPLv2 of later.",
  "The project does not host, run, endorse or recommend any source, and does not distribute a list of them.": "Die projek huisves, bedryf, onderskryf of beveel geen bron aan nie, en versprei nie 'n lys van hulle nie.",
  "The release carries no update for this platform.": "Die vrystelling dra geen opdatering vir hierdie platform nie.",
  "The source fetched this already — it plays at once and keeps nothing on this device": "Die bron het dit reeds gehaal — dit speel dadelik en hou niks op hierdie toestel nie",
  "The torrent engine accepted the file but gave it no id.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: The torrent engine accepted the file but gave it no id.",
  "The torrent engine accepted the magnet but gave it no id.": "Die torrentenjin het die magneet aanvaar maar het dit geen ID gegee nie.",
  "The torrent engine, embedded in the app. MIT licensed.": "Die torrentenjin, ingebed in die program. MIT-gelisensieer.",
  "The torrent stream isn't ready yet (engine replied HTTP {status}). It may still be fetching metadata from peers.": "Die torrentstroom is nog nie gereed nie (enjin het HTTP {status} geantwoord). Dit haal dalk nog metadata by eweknieë.",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "Die opdatering kon nie geïnstalleer word nie: {error}",
  "Theme": "Tema",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Hier is skaars plek vir een film. Steek 'n USB-skyf in die boks — as FAT32 geformateer, wat elke Android-boks aanvaar — en dit verskyn hierbo om eerder daarop af te laai.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "Daar is geen rekening om by aan te meld nie en niks sinkroniseer na 'n bediener nie. Wat jy kyk, hoe ver jy gekom het, jou gunstelinge en jou kyklys word alles op hierdie toestel gestoor en verlaat dit nooit nie. Sinkronisasie tussen skerms is beplan; tot dan is die rugsteun hieronder hoe 'n biblioteek beweeg.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "Daar is geen {file} in jou dokumentevouer nie. Kopieer een daarheen en probeer weer.",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "Hierdie verbinding is op die oomblik gemeter.",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "Hierdie verbinding is op die oomblik nie gemeter nie.",
  "This content is rated {rating} and exceeds your parental control settings.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This content is rated {rating} and exceeds your parental control settings.",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Rivulet's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This copy wasn't installed by Rivulet's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "Hierdie toestel se dekodeerder het op die lêer opgegee. Dit is gewoonlik die klank: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) en DTS is nie in die stelselwebaansig gelisensieer nie, so 'n vrystelling wat een dra, speel as 'n prent sonder klank, of glad nie. 'n x264-vrystelling met AAC-klank sal speel.",
  "This file has one audio track.": "Hierdie lêer het een klankbaan.",
  "This is separate from the performance switch below on purpose. That one turns off blur, which is expensive to draw; the movement here is built out of the two things a graphics chip does almost for free, so a television can usually keep it.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This is separate from the performance switch below on purpose. That one turns off blur, which is expensive to draw; the movement here is built out of the two things a graphics chip does almost for free, so a television can usually keep it.",
